--TEST--
the run is read out of the file that declares the name rather than the open one, because a declaration's statements are kept for every file the graph reached, `rule:ide/an-open-document-is-its-own-entry-point`
--FILE--
<?nvs
require 'lib/user.nvs';

var $u = new Us<|>er();
echo $u->name;
--FILE lib/user.nvs--
<?nvs
/// The person the library declares.
class User
{
    public string $name = "";
}
--REQUEST--
hover
--EXPECT--
The person the library declares.
